    "MODULES: error_coupling_simulator/certify/{core,facade,types}.py -- the certify engine trio.",
    "  * core.py -- the torch-free statistical backbone (route -> controls-first -> score -> ledger):",
    "    emitted_statistic, reduce_rr_corr, reduce_spatial_corr, total_variation, compare, route,",
    "    certify_cells + the MeasureCtx measurement facade (.score/.corrupt_answer). 9 public units.",
    "  * facade.py -- certify_teacher, the one-call spine (auto-anchor build + level grid + merge).",
    "    1 public unit (_regime is a private helper, not a unit). Imports torch TRANSITIVELY via",
    "    .anchors -> dm_oracle, but the covered paths never reach a GPU: DMOracleAnchor(device='cuda')",
    "    only builds a torch.device + reads torch.cuda.is_available() (-> False on a CPU box -> card",
    "    budget 0 -> the DM leg is infeasible-as-data, so answer() -- the only GPU path -- is never hit.",
    "  * types.py -- the value types (Exactness/Statistic/Verdict enums; Regime/Feasibility/Capability/",
    "    AnchorValue/LedgerRow frozen dataclasses, no __post_init__) + the runtime_checkable Protocol",
    "    ports (Anchor/Control/ControlledTeacher/DMReplayable/CliffordSliceable) + CertReport. The enums",
    "    and dataclasses carry NO method bodies (0 public units); the 15 method-bearing units are the 3",
    "    CertReport methods (row/summary/assert_pass -- real bodies + branches) + the 12 Protocol",
    "    stub methods (docstring + '...'; coverage.py counts neither a docstring nor an Ellipsis stub",
    "    as a statement, so the stub bodies are 100%-covered by IMPORT + score branch 0/0).",
    "",
    "ALL 25 units are CPU-COVERABLE (the 'Mixed' units certify_cells/certify_teacher/",
    "MeasureCtx.corrupt_answer/.score are covered with the tests/test_certify.py in-memory stub pattern",
    "-- FakeTeacher/MemAnchor -- a known law that shares no code with any engine, no GPU). out_of_scope",
    "is therefore EMPTY.",
    "",
    "BRANCH SURFACE (coverage.py --branch): single-line ternaries + generator/comprehension bodies emit",
    "NO tracked branch arc, so compare's six ternaries, MeasureCtx.score's two, emitted_statistic's",
    "'... if R>1 else' ternary, and the certify_cells/certify_teacher/route comprehensions are branch",
